<noinclude>
Stores a task as SMW properties (Tt name/job/status). Created and edited via [[Form:Task]]. A task belongs to a job
(<code>job</code> holds the job's page id); the name is shown via <code>DISPLAYTITLE</code>. Time is logged against a
task from the timer or the weekly timesheet grid, or against the job's "General" bucket.
[[Category:Time tracker templates]]
</noinclude><includeonly>{{#default_form:Task}}{{#set:
|Tt name={{{name|}}}
|Tt job={{{job|}}}
|Tt status={{{status|active}}}
}}{{DISPLAYTITLE:{{{name|{{PAGENAME}}}}}}}<div class="tt-header-row"><div class="tt-card tt-entity">
<div class="tt-facts">
<div class="tt-fact"><span class="tt-fact-label">Customer</span><span class="tt-fact-value">{{#timetracker_job_customer:{{{job|}}}}}</span></div>
<div class="tt-fact"><span class="tt-fact-label">Job</span><span class="tt-fact-value">{{#if:{{{job|}}}|[[{{{job}}}]]|—}}</span></div>
<div class="tt-fact"><span class="tt-fact-label">Status</span><span class="tt-fact-value"><span class="tt-badge tt-badge-{{lc:{{{status|active}}}}}">{{int:timetracker-status-{{lc:{{{status|active}}}}}}}</span></span></div>
</div>
</div>{{#timetracker_jobtimer:{{{job|}}}|{{FULLPAGENAME}}}}</div>
<h2 class="tt-section">⏱️ Timesheet</h2>
{{#timetracker_grid:task|{{FULLPAGENAME}}|{{{job|}}}|{{{name|}}}}}
[[Category:Tasks]]
</includeonly>
